{"assets":["/statement-assets/381e2b3ceef5cfced2ed143556b1a1280152cf7d11b6f86a2781dba5ffa6ba07.png","/statement-assets/ce56e6059e8a232e698b0a90d1008ab846812e71de29ee2aa7af889315610d2e.png","/statement-assets/98904c1d0124cb758442f48c4654f4b701c866a2984ebe4fdba1060b462c4d7b.png","/statement-assets/da6cf57fee58dcae7e80c4e6211ccbe602015fd6b10a975082ea7c634febd8ec.png","/statement-assets/d631b6571a13f3fc031f7e7dbe73d0c6bef59bfc5e753d597d5472458913cc73.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"77","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Domino Carpet"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"...Mike the TV greets you again!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tired of the monotonous furniture? Sick of gray routine? Dreaming about dizzying changes in your humble abode? We have something to offer you!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This domino carpet for only $99.99 will change your life! You can lay it on the floor, hang it on the wall or even on the ceiling! Among other things ..."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Having watched the commercial, virus Hexadecimal also wanted to get a Domino Carpet and wanted badly to be photographed in front of it. But of course, a virus will never consent to buying a licensed Carpet! So she ordered a truck of dominoes and decided to make such a Carpet herself. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The original Domino Carpet is a field of squares "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n × m"},{"kind":"text","text":" in size. Each square is half of a domino, and can be rotated either vertically or horizontally, independently from its neighbors. Vertically rotated domino halves look like this: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/381e2b3ceef5cfced2ed143556b1a1280152cf7d11b6f86a2781dba5ffa6ba07.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"And horizontally rotated halves look like this: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ce56e6059e8a232e698b0a90d1008ab846812e71de29ee2aa7af889315610d2e.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notice, that some halves looks the same in both rotations, but other halves differ."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dominoes bought by Hexadecimal are represented by uncuttable chips "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" in size, which can be laid either vertically or horizontally. If the chip is laid vertically, then both of it's halves should be laid vertically orientated; if the chip is laid horizontally, then both of it's halves should be laid horizontally."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The samples of valid and invalid dominoes laid vertically and horizontally are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/98904c1d0124cb758442f48c4654f4b701c866a2984ebe4fdba1060b462c4d7b.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Virus Hexadecimal assembles her own Domino Carpet so that the following conditions are satisfied:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" each carpet square is covered by a domino chip, i.e. there are no empty squares; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" all domino chips lie entirely within the carpet and don't overlap with each other; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if there is a horizontal domino chip with its left half in column "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" then there are no horizontal domino chips with their left halves in columns "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Before starting to assemble her own Domino Carpet, the virus wants to know the number of ways to achieve the intended purpose modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can assume that the virus has an infinitely large number of dominoes of each type."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":", separated by a space — the size of the Domino Carpet ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 250"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4m + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" symbols. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each square of the Domino Carpet, which is a domino half, is described by a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3 × 3"},{"kind":"text","text":" square. Symbol "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'O'"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in this square indicates the presence of a point, symbol "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'.'"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — its absence. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3 × 3"},{"kind":"text","text":" square is delineated from adjacent squares by symbols "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'#'"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" as shown in the examples. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that every box describes the correct half of a domino. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In all pretests the Domino Carpets have the size of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 × 4"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number, the number of ways to assemble the Domino Carpet modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":", using only standard dominoes of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 4\n#################\n#O..#...#O.O#...#\n#.O.#.O.#.O.#...#\n#..O#...#O.O#...#\n#################\n#O.O#OOO#O.O#...#\n#.O.#...#...#.O.#\n#O.O#OOO#O.O#...#\n#################\n#O.O#...#O.O#...#\n#...#...#...#.O.#\n#O.O#...#O.O#...#\n#################\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 2\n#########\n#O.O#O.O#\n#.O.#...#\n#O.O#O.O#\n#########\n#...#O.O#\n#...#...#\n#...#O.O#\n#########\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 2\n#########\n#..O#O..#\n#...#...#\n#O..#..O#\n#########\n#O..#..O#\n#...#...#\n#..O#O..#\n#########\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A note to the first example:"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" all correct ways to make Domino Carpet are represented below:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/da6cf57fee58dcae7e80c4e6211ccbe602015fd6b10a975082ea7c634febd8ec.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"And this way is incorrect:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d631b6571a13f3fc031f7e7dbe73d0c6bef59bfc5e753d597d5472458913cc73.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"77D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/77/problem/D"}